<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/14/eng@/~cl_10> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/14/eng@> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/14/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/14/eng@/~cl_10> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "10" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/14/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/14/eng@/~cl_10> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#clause> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/14/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/14/eng@/~cl_10> <https://schema.org/text> "Any order, exemption, notice, direction or decision made or given by the Commission under the Malaysian Aviation Commission Act 2015 before the date of coming into operation of this Act shall, on the date of coming into operation of this Act, be deemed to have been made or given by the Authority under the Civil Aviation Authority of Malaysia Act 2017 until the expiry date of the order, exemption, notice, direction or decision and subject to the terms and conditions attached to the order, exemption, notice, direction or decision. Membership of Commission, etc."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/14/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/14/eng@/~cl_11> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#has_part> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/14/eng@/~cl_11__subsec_1> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/14/eng@> .
