<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/14/eng@/~cl_8> <https://schema.org/text> "Any application made or complaint received under the Malaysian Aviation Commission Act 2015 which is still pending before the date of coming into operation of this Act shall, on the date of coming into operation of this Act, be dealt under the Civil Aviation Authority of Malaysia Act 2017. Saving for licence, permit and air traffic right"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/14/eng@> .
